# God of War: Betrayal -- rename map (input to tools/rename_gow.py).
# Old (obfuscated) names on the left, new names on the right. Only members whose
# role was confirmed from call sites are renamed; see docs/CLASS_MAP.md for the
# evidence and for what is still unknown. Anything not listed keeps its name.
#
#   class  <old> <New>
#   field  <oldClass>.<oldField> <newName>
#   method <oldClass>.<oldMethod>(<paramTypes>) <newName>
#
# paramTypes are Java-style, comma separated, package-free, obfuscated class
# names left as they are, e.g. (int,byte[]) (Graphics,c[],int) ().

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- classes
# Phase 1 seed: the engine base / resource loader (a), the sprite-frame
# rectangle (c), the audio player (d) and the game itself (e) are certain.
# `b` (offscreen Image + Graphics + sprite arrays, created by b.a(240, 320)) is a
# tentative "Scene": a 240x320 render target/tile layer. Naming it at all is also
# required: Engine has a field `b`, which shadows the class name in source form.
class a Engine
class c Sprite
class d SoundPlayer
class e Game
class b Scene

